db/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499500 #edb/ref 1071 "Simplify the expression $y\\cdot \\sqrt[4]{y}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499500 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "842d5936-85a3-5b6e-b4fa-f505a9d0860b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499500 #edb/ref 1074 "First, we rewrite the radical as a fractional exponent:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\cdot \\sqrt[4]{y}=y\\cdot {y}^{1/4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\cdot {y}^{1/4} & = \\\\ {y}^{1+1/4} & = \\\\ {y}^{5/4}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we express the result as a radical:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{5/4} & =\\sqrt[4]{{y}^{5}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186499327 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1069 "q-141984" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1071 "${({a}^{2}b)}^{3}\\cdot ab=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "8bcb7c88-fa9c-5de4-82d6-48872f12ed89" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499508 #edb/ref 1074 "We start by using the power of product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({a}^{2}b)}^{3}\\cdot ab=({a}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {b}^{3}\\cdot ab & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we use the power rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}({a}^{2})^{3}\\cdot {b}^{3}\\cdot ab & = \\\\ {a}^{2\\cdot 3}\\cdot {b}^{3}\\cdot ab & = \\\\ {a}^{6}\\cdot {b}^{3}\\cdot ab & \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we use the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}^{6}\\cdot {b}^{3}\\cdot ab & = \\\\ ({a}^{6}\\cdot a)\\cdot ({b}^{3}\\cdot b) & = \\\\ {a}^{6+1}\\cdot {b}^{3+1} & = \\\\ {a}^{7}\\cdot {b}^{4} & = \\\\ {a}^{7}{b}^{4} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499524 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186499415 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499524 #edb/ref 1069 "q-104671" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186499524 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1