t {v}^{4\\cdot 5}} & = \\\\ \\frac{{u}^{10}}{(-32)\\cdot {v}^{20}} & = \\\\ -\\frac{{u}^{10}}{32{v}^{20}} & \\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
